## Rendering Stack: MoltenVK (Vulkan → Metal)

MoltenVK is bundled with Wine as `lib/libMoltenVK.dylib` (or via `lib64/libMoltenVK.dylib` in CX). It implements the Vulkan API on top of Metal. This is the layer DXVK uses.

Wine 11.5 from Gcenx ships MoltenVK 1.4.1 (CLI-verified: `[mvk-info] MoltenVK version 1.4.1, supporting Vulkan version 1.4.334`). This supports M3 Pro GPU Family Metal 3.

